t)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;startArrow=none;endArrow=block;endFill=1;dashed=1;strokeColor=#9673A6;fontSize=10;fontColor=#9673A6;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="lead" target="account"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="220" y="100"/><mxPoint x="1280" y="100"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6C8EBF&quot;&gt;■&lt;/font&gt; Standard object &amp;nbsp; &lt;font color=&quot;#82B366&quot;&gt;■&lt;/font&gt; Custom object&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#D79B00&quot;&gt;■&lt;/font&gt; Platform event &amp;nbsp; &lt;font color=&quot;#9673A6&quot;&gt;■&lt;/font&gt; Custom metadata / setting&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;PK&lt;/b&gt; primary key · &lt;b&gt;FK&lt;/b&gt; relationship field&lt;br&gt;Red thick line: Master-Detail (child deleted with parent)&lt;br&gt;Grey line: Lookup (optional) · crow's foot = many&lt;br&gt;Purple dashed: Lead conversion to Person Account&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Lifecycle&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;LINE friend → Lead (Open) → first message → Working - Contacted&lt;br&gt;→ checkout link (Stripe_Sub_ID__c) → optional failed payment&lt;br&gt;(Pending Payment contract on the Lead) → first successful payment&lt;br&gt;→ Lead converts to Person Account; contract, payments, assets&lt;br&gt;and chat move to the Account." style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=11;fillColor=#F8F9F9;strokeColor=#BFC9CA;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1560" y="120" width="400" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>